nal Account statement - showing the transfer of 7 234 803 UAH (approx 161 000 Eur) from the accumulated assets value."},{"title":"Business Plan Financial projections","tag":"Source of Funds","criticality":"Critical","due":"2024-11-06","description":"Kindly submit detailed 3 year financial projections (not just one), which also include the projected marketing expenses and commissions paid to any platform/content provider and any loans paid or benefits provided by such third-party provider.","notes":"Customer Reply updated business plan is updated in the portal"},{"title":"Compliance Officer","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2024-10-22","description":"The applicant is required to identify a compliance officer, fluent in AML and to submit their PHDF","notes":null},{"title":"Underage Players","tag":"Player Registration","criticality":"Critical","due":"2024-11-13","description":"The registration form does not require the user's DOB and a sentence confirming the user is over 18 and accepting the T&Cs is ticked by default. The registration form should cater for underage players.","notes":"Customer Reply the registration page has been updated accordingly."},{"title":"Prohibited Jurisdictions","tag":"Question","criticality":"Critical","due":"2024-11-13","description":"The Terms & Conditions only mention prohibited jurisdictions as dictated by each game provider, however there is no general list of prohibited jurisdictions for the website. Users from Curacao, The Netherlands, US and sanctioned/blacklisted jurisdictions should be prohibited from registering and using the website.","notes":"Customer Reply the registration page has been updated accordingly. Confirmed. To be tested again during audit."}]}]}]}